questions.q:
Given this Script Include method:
```javascript
_hasOverlap: function(start, end) {
  return false;
}
```
can a GlideAjax call from the client reach `_hasOverlap` directly, assuming the Script Include is Client callable?

In this method —
```javascript
checkDateRange: function() {
  var start = this.getParameter('sysparm_start');
  var end = this.getParameter('sysparm_end');
  return this._hasOverlap(start, end) ? 'true' : 'false';
}
```
why can `checkDateRange` be called by GlideAjax's `sysparm_name` even though it internally calls `_hasOverlap`?
